title: "Reproducibility package: The reversal of gender disparities in the retention and promotion of Big 4 auditors"
abstract: >-
  Code and documentation reproducing the tables and figures in "The reversal of
  gender disparities in the retention and promotion of Big 4 auditors"
  (Review of Accounting Studies). The licensed employment and audit data the
  analysis runs on are not redistributed; see DATA_AVAILABILITY.md.
